&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carbon Weave finish (Metallic or Matt Carbon)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid block characters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MIPA 2K-HS-Klarlack CS95 clearcoat (Germany)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MIPA Metallic Silver Spray-painted (Metallic option)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 options (Small/Big Flakes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not sticker, Not hydrodip&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UV resistant, Chemical resistant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhesive bonded (No gap between alphabets and baseplate)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3mm thick Glossy or Matt Satin Casted Acrylic (Laser-cut, not laminated)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly visible at all Distance and Angles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VEP/ANPR Friendly (readable by camera systems at customs and condominium gantries)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crafted locally in Singapore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="faq"&gt;Frequently Asked Questions&lt;/h2&gt;
